    "body": "My inclination would be to eagerly strip leading and trailing U+0009 and U+0020 from both name and value. (ASCII whitespace ends up being the same because of the C0 check at the start, but it's not as clear.)\r\n\r\nAnd I think we want to do it eagerly so the maximum size check also doesn't take the whitespace into account and therefore ends up matching what happens on the network layer side.",
